  description: "Phosphorus is a chemical element with symbol P and atomic number
    15. As an element, phosphorus exists in two major forms\u2014white phosphorus
    and red phosphorus\u2014but due to its high reactivity, phosphorus is never found
    as a free element on Earth. Instead phosphorus-containing minerals are almost
    always present in their maximally oxidised state, as inorganic phosphate rocks."
